{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOS","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"约书亚记","commonName":"约书亚记","title":"约书亚记","order":6,"numberOfChapters":24,"sha256":"c502e3d302da93deec012ca46e0a7f4b1eab3d63492954c2b63f32a5325beeb4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":24,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JOS/24.json","totalNumberOfVerses":656},"chapter":{"number":16,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["分给以法莲支派和玛拿西半支派的土地"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["约瑟的子孙拈阄所得之地是从靠近耶利哥的约旦河起，以耶利哥东边的水为界：从耶利哥上去，通过山地的旷野，到伯特利；"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["又从伯特利到路斯，接连到亚基人的境界，至亚他绿；"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["又往西下到押利提人的境界，到下伯·和 的境界，直到基色，通到海为止。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["约瑟的儿子玛拿西、以法莲就得了他们的地业。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["以法莲支派"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["以法莲子孙的境界，按着宗族所得的，记在下面：他们地业的东界是亚他绿·亚达到上伯·和 ；"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["往西通到北边的密米他，又向东绕到他纳·示罗，又接连到雅挪哈的东边；"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["从雅挪哈下到亚他绿，又到拿拉，达到耶利哥，通到约旦河为止；"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["从他普亚往西，到加拿河，直通到海为止。这就是以法莲支派按着宗族所得的地业。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["另外在玛拿西人地业中得了些城邑和属城的村庄。这都是分给以法莲子孙的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他们没有赶出住基色的迦南人；迦南人却住在以法莲人中间，成为做苦工的仆人，直到今日。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JOS/16.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JOS/17.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JOS/15.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}